	(text_box "Port 2 = sub-slot A1.2, hub port 2, busid 1-1.2.\nINA226 at 0x43; expander U2 (0x20).\nILIM 47k: 0.50–0.62 A; the -1 latches off after 7.5 ms in limit, FAULT_N flags it.\nINA226 Vbus on the shunt's load-side sense pad (= VBUS).\nEN pulled down: the port stays off until the node switches it on.\nPins: P1–P8 → crosspoint X lines (docs/electronics.md › DATA ×4 v2 map);\n  the LSF0108 passes nothing while the port's VBUS is off or its VREF is unconnected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 157.48 0)
		(size 294.64 20.32)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
